{"availability":"available","full":"pranjal2410719/Nexus","name":"Nexus","description":"A robust, full-stack Next.js application featuring a custom authentication gateway. Engineered with secure sessions, protected API routes, and seamless client-server integration to rapidly kickstart your next user-focused SaaS web platform.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-08T03:45:12Z","updated":"2026-10-10T05:15:20Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://nexus2231.netlify.app/","topics":[],"demo":"https://nexus2231.netlify.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:50.525Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:50.525Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:50.525Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:07:50.525Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Nexus v3.1.0 — Security-hardened, scheduler-fixed, atomic-capped release. See CHANGELOG.md for detailed version history.","Nexus is a serverless, multi-tenant GitHub commit scheduler — a Next.js app deployed on Netlify. Every user connects their own repository, configures their own daily bursts, and Nexus fires authentic conventional commits (feat(dsa/trees), fix(dsa/dp), …) with verified C++ implementations and complexity breakdowns — fully isolated per user.","Sign in with GitHub OAuth, encrypted tokens at rest, per-user data in Netlify Blobs, and a single heartbeat scheduler that serves everyone."],"features":["Next.js App Router — route handlers serve the API (/api/), the frontend is a single-page React dashboard.","Per-user isolation — every commit runs with your encrypted token against your repo. No shared GitHub identity, no cross-user access.","GitHub OAuth login — no passwords; your GitHub account is your account.","Custom burst schedule — set any number of daily slots (HH:MM) in your own timezone, 1–10 commits each.","Heartbeat scheduler — one Netlify scheduled function fa